<title>LEBANON: Israeli warplanes strike south Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Israeli warplanes strike south Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>NABATIYEH, Lebanon 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli warplanes rocketed suspected Hizbollah guerrilla targets in south Lebanon on Sunday, witnesses said.</p>
<p>Two planes fired two rockets at the Iqlim al-Toufah mountain ridge which is controlled by pro-Iranian Hizbollah (Party of God) guerrillas and used for attacks on Israel's south Lebanon occupation zone. No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
